                                                "sense_id": "f7ae46be-7026-346f-8367-8ace48ef11ce",
                                                "text": "Material for the second MS library (herein MS2) came from a pool of tissues from two patients, one with acute, active lesions and widespread inflammatory involvement in the white matter, and the other with chronic, \"silent\" lesions, with gliosis, but without evidence of a lymphocytic infiltrate."
